IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `psa93-types`
IMPORT `psa93-leavers`
IMPORT `psa93-transfers`
IMPORT `psa93-goal`

-- Pension Schemes Act 1993 (UK) — the encoder's tests. Expected values are
-- worked by hand from the Act.

§ `Tests`

-- Fields: began, ended, earlier days, all money purchase, pre-2014
-- service, personal pension transfer, NPA date, NPA, employee contributions,
-- other contributions, transfer payment.
GIVEN began IS A DATE, ended IS A DATE, earlier IS A NUMBER, mp IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Leaver facts`
`a leaver from` began `to` ended `, earlier days` earlier `, money purchase` mp MEANS
    `Leaver facts` OF began, ended, earlier, mp, FALSE, FALSE, Date 1 3 2050, 67, 1000, 500, 300

§§ `Goal 1 — early leavers`

#ASSERT `is entitled to short service benefit` (`a leaver from` (Date 1 1 2024) `to` (Date 31 12 2025) `, earlier days` 0 `, money purchase` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`is entitled to short service benefit` (`a leaver from` (Date 1 1 2024) `to` (Date 30 12 2025) `, earlier days` 0 `, money purchase` FALSE))
#ASSERT `is entitled to short service benefit` (`a leaver from` (Date 1 1 2024) `to` (Date 30 12 2025) `, earlier days` 1 `, money purchase` FALSE)
-- s 71(1)(aa): 30 days, all money purchase.
#ASSERT `is entitled to short service benefit` (`a leaver from` (Date 1 3 2026) `to` (Date 30 3 2026) `, earlier days` 0 `, money purchase` TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`is entitled to short service benefit` (`a leaver from` (Date 1 3 2026) `to` (Date 29 3 2026) `, earlier days` 0 `, money purchase` TRUE))
#ASSERT NOT (`is entitled to short service benefit` (`Leaver facts` OF Date 1 3 2026, Date 30 3 2026, 0, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, Date 1 3 2050, 67, 1000, 500, 300))
-- s 71(1)(b)
#ASSERT `is entitled to short service benefit` (`Leaver facts` OF Date 1 3 2026, Date 2 3 2026, 0, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, Date 1 3 2050, 67, 1000, 500, 300)
-- s 101AA: three months, without short service benefit.
#ASSERT `may elect a cash transfer sum or contribution refund` (`a leaver from` (Date 1 3 2026) `to` (Date 31 5 2026) `, earlier days` 0 `, money purchase` FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`may elect a cash transfer sum or contribution refund` (`a leaver from` (Date 1 3 2026) `to` (Date 30 5 2026) `, earlier days` 0 `, money purchase` FALSE))
#ASSERT NOT (`may elect a cash transfer sum or contribution refund` (`a leaver from` (Date 1 1 2024) `to` (Date 31 12 2025) `, earlier days` 0 `, money purchase` FALSE))
-- s 101AB(4): £1,000 plus the lesser of £500 and the £300 transfer payment.
#ASSERT `the contribution refund for` (`a leaver from` (Date 1 3 2026) `to` (Date 31 5 2026) `, earlier days` 0 `, money purchase` FALSE) EQUALS 1300
-- s 71(3)
#ASSERT `the latest age from which short service benefit is payable for` (`a leaver from` (Date 1 1 2024) `to` (Date 31 12 2025) `, earlier days` 0 `, money purchase` FALSE) EQUALS 67
#ASSERT `the latest age from which short service benefit is payable for` (`Leaver facts` OF Date 1 1 2024, Date 31 12 2025, 0, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, Date 1 3 2050, 60, 0, 0, 0) EQUALS 65

§§ `Goal 2 — transfers`

near MEANS `Leaver facts` OF Date 1 1 2000, Date 31 12 2025, 0, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, Date 1 3 2027, 65, 0, 0, 0
far MEANS `a leaver from` (Date 1 1 2000) `to` (Date 31 12 2025) `, earlier days` 0 `, money purchase` FALSE

-- Fields: money purchase, flexible, guarantee date, applied, forfeiture
-- concluded, carried out.
GIVEN mp IS A BOOLEAN, flex IS A BOOLEAN, applied IS A MAYBE DATE, concluded IS A MAYBE DATE, done IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A `Transfer facts`
`a transfer, money purchase` mp `, flexible` flex `, applied` applied `, proceedings concluded` concluded `, done` done MEANS
    `Transfer facts` OF mp, flex, Date 15 1 2026, applied, concluded, done

-- Guarantee date 15 January 2026: three months end 14 April 2026.
#ASSERT `the last day to apply for a transfer for` far `with` (`a transfer, money purchase` FALSE `, flexible` FALSE `, applied` NOTHING `, proceedings concluded` NOTHING `, done` NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (Date 14 4 2026)
-- Normal pension age 1 March 2027: one year before is 1 March 2026.
#ASSERT `the last day to apply for a transfer for` near `with` (`a transfer, money purchase` FALSE `, flexible` FALSE `, applied` NOTHING `, proceedings concluded` NOTHING `, done` NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (Date 1 3 2026)
#ASSERT `the last day to apply for a transfer for` near `with` (`a transfer, money purchase` FALSE `, flexible` TRUE `, applied` NOTHING `, proceedings concluded` NOTHING `, done` NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (Date 14 4 2026)
#ASSERT `the last day to apply for a transfer for` near `with` (`a transfer, money purchase` TRUE `, flexible` TRUE `, applied` NOTHING `, proceedings concluded` NOTHING `, done` NOTHING) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT NOT (`the transfer right is lost for` near `with` (`a transfer, money purchase` FALSE `, flexible` FALSE `, applied` (JUST (Date 1 3 2026)) `, proceedings concluded` NOTHING `, done` NOTHING))
#ASSERT `the transfer right is lost for` near `with` (`a transfer, money purchase` FALSE `, flexible` FALSE `, applied` (JUST (Date 2 3 2026)) `, proceedings concluded` NOTHING `, done` NOTHING)
#ASSERT `the transfer right is lost for` far `with` (`a transfer, money purchase` FALSE `, flexible` FALSE `, applied` NOTHING `, proceedings concluded` NOTHING `, done` NOTHING)
-- s 99(2): 6 months beginning 15 January (14 July) or 1 March (31 August);
-- s 99(3): proceedings concluded 1 June: 1 September is later.
#ASSERT `the trustees' last day to transfer for` (`a transfer, money purchase` FALSE `, flexible` FALSE `, applied` (JUST (Date 1 3 2026)) `, proceedings concluded` NOTHING `, done` NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (Date 14 7 2026)
#ASSERT `the trustees' last day to transfer for` (`a transfer, money purchase` TRUE `, flexible` TRUE `, applied` (JUST (Date 1 3 2026)) `, proceedings concluded` NOTHING `, done` NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (Date 31 8 2026)
#ASSERT `the trustees' last day to transfer for` (`a transfer, money purchase` FALSE `, flexible` FALSE `, applied` (JUST (Date 1 3 2026)) `, proceedings concluded` (JUST (Date 1 6 2026)) `, done` NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (Date 1 9 2026)
#ASSERT `the trustees' last day to transfer for` (`a transfer, money purchase` FALSE `, flexible` FALSE `, applied` (JUST (Date 1 3 2026)) `, proceedings concluded` (JUST (Date 1 3 2026)) `, done` NOTHING) EQUALS JUST (Date 14 7 2026)
-- s 99(7)
#ASSERT `the trustees must notify the Regulator for` (`a transfer, money purchase` FALSE `, flexible` FALSE `, applied` (JUST (Date 1 3 2026)) `, proceedings concluded` NOTHING `, done` (JUST (Date 16 7 2026)))
-- Changed after the independent pass: 15 July is after the six months
-- beginning 15 January (which end 14 July).
#ASSERT `the trustees must notify the Regulator for` (`a transfer, money purchase` FALSE `, flexible` FALSE `, applied` (JUST (Date 1 3 2026)) `, proceedings concluded` NOTHING `, done` (JUST (Date 15 7 2026)))
#ASSERT NOT (`the trustees must notify the Regulator for` (`a transfer, money purchase` FALSE `, flexible` FALSE `, applied` (JUST (Date 1 3 2026)) `, proceedings concluded` NOTHING `, done` (JUST (Date 14 7 2026))))

§§ `The top-level goal`

pos MEANS `the leaver position for` (`Leaver case` OF (`a leaver from` (Date 1 3 2026) `to` (Date 31 5 2026) `, earlier days` 0 `, money purchase` FALSE), NOTHING)
#ASSERT NOT (pos's `entitled to short service benefit`)
#ASSERT pos's `may elect a cash transfer sum or contribution refund`
#ASSERT pos's `contribution refund` EQUALS JUST 1300
#ASSERT pos's `latest age short service benefit is payable from` EQUALS NOTHING
